    and market positioning are not soft add-ons here; they decide who gets handed the client-facing project
    versus who stays on routine sample-room work.
  </p>

  <p>
    <strong>This is really the whole game:</strong> the "fashion designer" title decides which room you
    walk into, but a genuine <strong>high-value skill portfolio</strong>, design and production depth plus
